export anchor PapelPicadoStyle:
    number: 148
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Papel picado
    idea: The dashboard hangs from strings of cut tissue paper banners, with bright paper flags carrying the totals, scalloped and pierced edges on every panel and a festive but readable layout on white.
    base: light
    palette:
        tissueWhite: #fffdf8, the page and the punched holes in every flag
        ink: #2a2340, text, outlines and the button shadow
        muted: #5b5470, dates, labels and meta
        pinkPaper: #ff5fa8, flags, this week bars and panel tops
        tealPaper: #24c1c1, flags, last week bars and the bell
        yellowPaper: #ffd23f, flags, the current tab and section tags
        purplePaper: #9a6bf0, garland flags only, never behind text
        orangePaper: #ff8a3d, flags and the avatar
        greenPaper: #48c774, flags
        magenta: #c2185b, the brand, the primary button and dashed focus
        okGreen: #1d7a3a, On track
        riskAmber: #8a5a00, At risk
        overdueRed: #b4232a, Behind and overdue
        string: #7a6f8f, the strings flags hang from
    type:
        Headings, labels and figures use ui-rounded, SF Pro Rounded,
        Arial Rounded MT Bold, Nunito, Varela Round, Trebuchet MS,
        sans-serif at weight 800. Body uses Trebuchet MS, Segoe UI,
        Ubuntu, Verdana, sans-serif. Greeting 48px with the name in
        magenta, flag figures 52px, section titles 28px, row titles 19px,
        body 16px at 1.5, status pills 15px.
    layout:
        A garland of sixteen small flags in all six paper colours hangs
        along the top from a curved string, each pierced with a polka dot
        of holes, a zigzag bottom and a diamond or round cut out, tilted
        slightly. The header bar overlaps it with a magenta zigzag
        bottomed brand flag, pill nav with a yellow current pill, a pill
        search, a magenta pill button with a hard ink shadow, a teal round
        bell and an orange avatar. The hero pairs a big greeting, date and
        an outlined red notice naming 4 overdue tasks with four large
        flags hung on a curved string, each a pierced coloured flag with a
        white arched card holding the figure and label, alternately
        tilted. Projects sit in one outlined panel topped by a pierced
        teal strip, each row with a small pierced flag showing the
        percent, the name with category and due date, a striped paper
        progress bar with tasks and percent, and an outlined status pill.
        Chart and activity sit side by side in panels topped with yellow
        and orange strips, the chart with scalloped topped bars pierced by
        diamonds, teal last week and pink this week. Each section title
        has three tiny flags before it. On phones the garland shortens,
        totals go two by two and rows stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 32px gutters, 48px between sections, 14 by 20px rows.
    density: Airy and festive.
    corners: Pills for buttons, tabs, fields and status, 18px panels, zigzag bottoms on flags and round arched tops on cards inside them.
    borders: 2px ink outlines on panels, buttons and fields, dotted dividers between rows and a pierced coloured strip at the top of each panel.
    shadows: Only a hard 4px ink shadow under the primary button.
    icons:
        Bold rounded line icons. Status uses a ticked circle for On track,
        a triangle with an exclamation for At risk and a rounded square
        with a down arrow for Behind, inside outlined pills with the word.
    focus: A 3px dashed magenta outline offset 3px.
    tone: Cheerful and short, such as Good morning, Mara! and Last week 59.
